# Blog images

Never attach brand, Shopify, Firewire, press, or other copyrighted product photos to a Reswell blog post.

Allowed image sources only:

- Unsplash, Pexels, Pixabay (standard free licenses — not Unsplash+)
- Wikimedia Commons files with a documented free license (credit in the caption)
- Photos Reswell owns or the author created, uploaded through the blog CMS

If no legal photo exists, **omit the image**. Cover is optional. Posts without a cover use the generated title card (`BlogTitleCover` in the app, `opengraph-image` for shares).

Do not hotlink manufacturer CDNs. Do not upload scraped catalog shots into `blog-images`. Instagram belongs in an embed block, not as a cover or inline image URL.
